  "title": "kNet: Fix Undefined Behavior in get_knet_pdu_len",
  "description": "dissect_content_length_vle returns an int. It's stored in the packet\nusing 31-bits, so it doesn't overflow by itself but adding the length\nof the length bytes to get the total PDU length could. Make sure\nunsigned arithmetic is used and no signed overflow. (It will never\noverflow an unsigned.)\n\nFix OSS-Fuzz Issue 446038793",
